# Netlist gate: every bit of the packed struct-array output must have a driver.
# The miter can be vacuous on undriven bits (sat reads them as 0), and the
# second half of the fix (a nested call writing an ELEMENT of the output formal
# from inside the body's loop) only shows up here.
read_uhdm slpp_all/surelog.uhdm
hierarchy -check -top void_func_call_in_case_arm
proc; flatten; opt_clean
check -assert
